    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nMOUNT STREET, CLAREMORRIS, CO. MAYO\r\n\r\nPRIME TOWN CENTRE DEVELOPMENT OPPORTUNITY\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE IN ONE, TWO OR THREE LOTS\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present one of the most significant development opportunities to come to the market in Claremorris in recent years.\r\n\r\nOccupying a prime position in the heart of Claremorris Town, this substantial property extends over a large town centre site and offers enormous potential for redevelopment, refurbishment or mixed-use development.\r\n\r\nThe property is available for sale in one, two or three sections, offering flexibility to developers, investors and owner occupiers alike.\r\n\r\nFormerly the site of a thriving supermarket, public house, restaurant, workshop and stores, the property comprises a range of buildings, many of which are structurally sound and suitable for refurbishment, conversion or incorporation into a larger development scheme.\r\n\r\nThe site also includes valuable development lands offering excellent potential for residential, commercial or mixed-use projects, subject to planning permission.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n• Prime town centre location\r\n• Available in one, two or three lots\r\n• Significant development opportunity\r\n• Former supermarket, public house, restaurant and commercial premises\r\n• Many existing buildings structurally sound\r\n• Ideal refurbishment or redevelopment project\r\n• Potential for residential, commercial or mixed-use development\r\n• Extensive frontage and town centre presence\r\n• All mains services connected\r\n• Walking distance to every town amenity\r\n\r\nServices:\r\n\r\n• Public water mains\r\n• Public sewerage\r\n• Electricity\r\n• Telephone and broadband services\r\n• Public lighting\r\n• Footpaths\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Located in the heart of Claremorris Town\r\n• Within 200 metres of Tesco, Aldi and a large public car park\r\n• Walking distance to church, swimming pool, leisure centre and library\r\n• Close to schools and community facilities\r\n• Approx. 500 metres from Claremorris Railway Station\r\n• Easy access to the N17 Galway–Sligo route\r\n• Approx. 15 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a landmark property with exceptional redevelopment potential in one of Mayo's fastest-growing towns.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nMartin Finn & Nigel Dineen Auctioneers\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No. 002031\r\n\r\n094 9362216 | 086 2130723\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided."
